Written 2026-10-01 10:02 AEST by a Spark brief-writer sub-agent for Wednesday, from `723dc0722b68`, `nft-certificate.openapi.ts` read at every line named here and the handler(s) read. Source: KS-1364 (Backlog, assigned to Kamil; created by Peter 2026-09-28 with the sweep-4 evidence): "One for the spec when convenient". Carve: this brief takes `POST /api/nft/verify/transaction` and `POST /api/nft/verify/asset` from the ticket's 17-operation table.

